LangGraph Agents Lab

This repository is a production-oriented refactoring of the original
ai_agents_langgraph project by MostafaK66:
https://github.com/MostafaK66/ai_agents_langgraph

The original repository did not contain a license file at the time of this
refactoring. The repository owner has licensed this version under the MIT
License in LICENSE. Third-party packages remain subject to their own licenses.

The default model was updated from legacy `gpt-3.5-turbo` to `gpt-4o-mini`, the
replacement recommended by the official OpenAI model documentation. It remains
fully configurable.
